{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The Shopping Spree", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Neither Do I", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe taste and style in fashion through a wider range of language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Words Ending in the Suffix <span class=\"italic\">-Age</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "The suffix <span class=\"italic\">-age</span> is used at the end of a word to show:<br/>fee: as in <span class=\"italic\">post<span class=\"strong\">age</span></span><br/>state:  as in <span class=\"italic\">herit<span class=\"strong\">age</span></span><br/>house : as in <span class=\"italic\">cott<span class=\"strong\">age</span></span><br/>total amount: as in <span class=\"italic\">foot<span class=\"strong\">age</span></span>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Some of the oldest examples of words ending in -age came into English from French.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Examples</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\"> damage, average, village, vintage, advantage</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Others are English following the French model.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Examples</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\">postage, footage, leverage, shortage, heritage</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You pronounce the suffix <span class=\"italic\">-age</span> as \u201cij\u201d", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice saying these words out loud:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "damage&nbsp;&nbsp;     (damij)<br/>postage &nbsp;    (postij)<br/>footage    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(footij)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Well, as <span class=\"strong\">leverage</span>, I have some great outtake <span class=\"strong\">footage</span> from our favorite sci-fi film. I got the <span class=\"strong\">package</span> from the official site this morning - <span class=\"strong\">postage</span> due. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We're in <span class=\"strong\">heritage village</span>. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Intonation: When You Are Sure vs When You Are Checking", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a falling tone to signal that you believe what you  have said is correct. <br/>You use a rising tone when you are checking, because you are not sure if you are correct.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "These two sentences are the same, but they have slightly different meanings as they are said differently, depending on the speaker's intention.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Try reading them out loud. Put falling intonation at the end of the first one. Put rising intonation at the end of the second one.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li>It worked, didn't it? &#10549;<br/>I'm sure it worked. I know it worked.</li><li>It worked, didn't it? &#10548;<br/>I'm not sure if it worked. I'm checking if I'm right.</li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Try saying this sentence with both rising and falling intonation:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">There's a Cambridge clothing shortage coming up, isn't there?  </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Falling Intonation</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There's a Cambridge clothing shortage coming up, isn't there?<br/><br/>You and Sally are just getting started.<br/><br/>You never want to cook. <br/><br/> It worked, didn't it?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I believe there will be shortage of clothing after you shop.<br/><br/>I know you shop a lot.<br/><br/>I know you don't like to cook.<br/><br/>I know it would work.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Rising Intonation</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">At the mall?<br/><br/>Is it a big shopping day?<br/><br/>You don't?<br/><br/>Is that a hint?<br/><br/>Are you asking to be invited to have dinner out somewhere with us?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm not sure where you are.<br/><br/>I think it could be an average shopping day.<br/><br/>Thought you would.<br/><br/>I am not sure if it's a hint.<br/><br/>I am not sure if you are asking me for an invitation.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "shortage", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not enough of an item", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There's a Cambridge clothing shortage coming up!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about shopping.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "heritage", "type": "name"}, {"content": "traditional; belonging to history", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  We're downtown in heritage village. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "leverage", "type": "name"}, {"content": "influence", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Well, as leverage, I have our favorite sci-fi film.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "postage", "type": "name"}, {"content": "what you pay to send a letter or package ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I got the package from the official site this morning - postage due. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "do some serious damage", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to spend a lot of money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Yes, we're out here shopping, doing some serious damage.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "shopathon", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a marathon shopping trip ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I don't think Peter is up to one of our shopathons. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "hint", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a statement that tells someone indirectly what you want them to know", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Is that a hint meaning you want me to invite you  to dinner?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le07ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Ask someone for information about what types of clothing they wear to school, work or at home.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down 6 to 10 questions about the type of clothing they like and colors they wear.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask the questions with the correct intonation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Respond to the answers with positive or negative agreement.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write the interview as a dialogue with the questions and answers.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about clothing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for information using proper intonation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use positive and negative agreement.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a dialogue with the questions and answers from the interview.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le07ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hey V? What's up?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sally and I are shopping.<br/><span the heritage village. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Is it a shopping day?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: About average I think. We don't have many bags yet!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You don't?"}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "19000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, but I think the advantage of bringing a friend is that you can carry more! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So do I. You and Sally are just getting started.  <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Uh huh. We're off to a vintage shop next. I don't think you're up to one of our shopathons.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Neither do I. I've been a bit tired this week.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So have I, but this is bringing my energy back. I don't want to cook tonight.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Neither will I.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You never want to cook. We'll want to eat out."}, {"image": "engenn8le07ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "43500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So will I!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Is that a hint?\nAre you asking to be invited to dinner out somewhere with us?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It worked, didn't it? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, Peter! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, as leverage, I have some great outtake footage from our favorite sci-fi film. I got the package from the official site this morning - postage due. I don't think that\u2018s usual.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Neither do I!  OK. How about you pick up some takeout and meet us at my place later?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Now that sounds like a plan!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le07ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le07ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "What different types of shopping areas are there in your city? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Why are they different?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What type of things do you go there for?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " I can say and use words that end in <span class=\"italic\">-age</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can use proper intonation when I'm sure and when I'm checking.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can agree or disagree with <span class=\"italic\">so</span> or <span class=\"italic\">neither</span>. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_h